elies on `removeEmptyDir` to prompt again when actually removing the directory itself. I need to pass the file info down to `removeFile` so it can generate the right description for the prompt, or alternatively handle the file prompting directly in `removePath` before delegating to the removal functions. Writing the removal functions... Writing the helper functions... Finishing the prompt logic...\n\nNow I'm thinking about how to handle interactive tests. The `runBin` test helper doesn't set up stdin, so I'll need to either modify it or use the `DiffTest` approach that has a Stdin field to properly test the interactive prompts.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":33878,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":635},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a3eabc76-d363-4d82-9921-dd26e42727d9","uuid":"8c57d23e-5612-4153-a170-ff67b91dcbab"}
