{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MWZXNFggnfG3Zxk8DqeDkm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `interactive_never_via_flag` test is failing. The issue is that `--interactive=never` in the code sets `opts.force = true`, which makes nonexistent files silently succeed. But GNU rm's `--interactive=never` does NOT imply force - it just means don't prompt. Let me verify:\n\n```\ngrm --interactive=never nonexistent\ngrm: cannot remove 'nonexistent': No such file or directory\nexit: 1\n```\n\nSo `--interactive=never` should NOT set force to true. It only means \"never prompt\". \n\nI need to fix the flag parsing logic so that `--interactive=never` only controls the prompting behavior without affecting force mode. The two behaviors are independent - setting interactive to never should just suppress prompts, not change how the tool handles missing files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1724,"cache_read_input_tokens":52212,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1724},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a3eabc76-d363-4d82-9921-dd26e42727d9","uuid":"4e52fe84-19ec-4102-b7f1-350659be4517"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MWZXNFggnfG3Zxk8DqeDkm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One failure: `--interactive=never` should not imply `--force`. GNU rm's `--interactive=never` only disables prompting — it doesn't suppress errors for nonexistent files. The bug is in `parseFlags`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1724,"cache_read_input_tokens":52212,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1724},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a3eabc76-d363-4d82-9921-dd26e42727d9","uuid":"af20b249-ad31-41fb-b0d2-5f128b84dbf5"}
